@startuml CQRS-Command-Side-Outbox-CDC-Sequence

actor User as "用户"
participant "API网关" as API
participant "命令服务\n(Command Service)" as CommandService
participant "数据库\n(写模型)" as WriteDB
participant "Outbox表" as Outbox
participant "消息发布者" as CDC
participant "消息队列\n(Kafka)" as Kafka
participant "读服务\n(Query Service)" as QueryService
participant "读数据库\n(读模型)" as ReadDB

== 命令处理阶段 ==
User -> API: 提交创建订单请求
API -> CommandService: CreateOrderCommand(cmd)
group 数据库事务 [原子性保障]
    CommandService -> WriteDB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    CommandService -> WriteDB: INSERT INTO orders (...)
    CommandService -> Outbox: INSERT INTO outbox\n(event_id, event_type, payload)
    CommandService -> WriteDB: COMMIT
end
CommandService -> API: 返回成功
API -> User: 操作成功

== 事件发布阶段 ==
CDC -> Outbox: 读取变更
Outbox --> CDC: 捕获新事件\n(OrderCreated)
group 事件路由 [可靠性投递]
    CDC -> CDC: 转换事件格式\n(应用EventRouter)
    CDC -> Kafka: PUBLISH\n(topic: "OrderCreated", payload)
end
Kafka -> QueryService: 订阅事件\n(OrderCreated)
QueryService -> ReadDB: UPSERT order_summary\n(更新读模型)
ReadDB --> QueryService: 确认更新

== 可选确认步骤 ==
QueryService -> Kafka: COMMIT_OFFSET\n(标记事件已处理)

@enduml